sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis-code-traceability> .
